# Data artifacts are verified by SHA-256 (frozen golden sets, the bake-off tasks, manifests): keep them LF on every
# checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says (owner decision 2026-10-10; a CRLF checkout broke the frozen golden hashes).
*.json    text eol=lf
*.jsonl   text eol=lf
*.csv     text eol=lf
*.parquet binary
*.npz     binary
*.onnx    binary
